# CR 603.4: Bot1 has seven cards in its graveyard when the upkeep trigger fires. Bot2 exiles that graveyard in response,
# removing the condition before resolution; De-evolve's enchanted creature remains on the battlefield.
# De-evolve {1}{B}: Enchantment — Aura
#   Enchant creature
#   Enchanted creature gets -4/-0, can't block, and is a Salamander. (It loses all other creature types.)
#   Threshold — At the beginning of each upkeep, if there are seven or more cards in your graveyard, exile enchanted creature.
# Written by new-card.py --scenario: De-evolve cast on turn 1 off zero-cost mana sources. Grow it a line at a time with
#   cargo run --profile cards -p cantrip-script --bin corpus -- --scenario de-evolve-aura-threshold-and-type-change --next --brief
# and see which keys the card moved with --diff <the line number of its cast>.

[Bot1 Deck]
De-evolve
Thought Scour
Thought Scour
Memnite
Black Lotus
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Swamp x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Tormod's Crypt
Island x20

